{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>觀塘有人猝死。今早（12日）約10時半，一名39歲姓鄭男子在藍田麗港街、麗港城家中廁內暈倒，其家人發現後報警求助。</p><p>救援人員趕至，消防破門進入廁所，但救護員經檢驗後，證實鄭男已明顯死亡。警方將案件列作「屍體發現」，正調查事件起因，並將安排為鄭男驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"麗港城。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221027/662419656719470592531890.jpeg/iEMRLkWsl2O682Qln7UorGpJ1fszcmGApZ1T56WdU-c\"/><figcaption>麗港城。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T12:59:07.760617+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T12:38:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T01:38:31.494918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T12:57:39.789562+00:00","content_hash":"f74e2c49e5b5e7c846e48bfef9b0c7553cfcd9861713320d48972672578160c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}